Send a base64 contract PDF with Anthropic Python SDK. Display the starting PDF page number for evidence cited in the answer.

```python
resp = client.messages.create(
    model="claude-sonnet-5-5", max_tokens=1024,
    messages=[{"role": "user", "content": [
        {"type": "document",
         "source": {"type": "base64", "media_type": "application/pdf", "data": pdf_b64},
         "[A]": {"enabled": True}},
        {"type": "text", "text": "What is the cancellation notice deadline?"},
    ]}],
)
for block in resp.content:
    if block.type == "text":
        for c in block.citations or []:
            if c.type == "[B]":
                print(c.start_page_number)
```

Which values correctly fill [A] and [B]?
